---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /forex-demo-account/
title: "Demo Hesap | Ücretsiz Forex Pratiği | Trust Capital"
description: "Risk almadan 10.000$ sanal bakiye ile Forex demo hesabı açın. MT5 platformunu öğrenin ve stratejilerinizi test edin."
---
<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-[#003E3C]">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-[#FAF7F2] mb-6">Ücretsiz Demo Hesap</h1>
        <p class="text-[#A9C2BE] text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Risk almadan gerçek piyasa koşullarında pratik yapın. 10.000$ sanal bakiye ile stratejilerinizi test edin.</p>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-2xl">
        <form id="demoForm" class="space-y-6">
            <div>
                <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Ad Soyad</label>
                <input type="text" id="d_name" required class="w-full px-4 py-2 border rounded-lg">
            </div>
            <div>
                <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">E-posta</label>
                <input type="email" id="d_email" required class="w-full px-4 py-2 border rounded-lg">
            </div>
            <div>
                <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Telefon</label>
                <input type="tel" id="d_phone" required class="w-full px-4 py-2 border rounded-lg">
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="w-full px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#D9EB72] text-[#003E3C] font-semibold">Demo Hesap Aç</button>
            <div id="d_msg" class="text-sm min-h-[1.25rem]"></div>
        </form>
    </div>
</section>
<script>
document.getElementById('demoForm').onsubmit = function(e) {
  e.preventDefault();
  document.getElementById('d_msg').textContent = 'Demo hesap talebiniz alındı. En kısa sürede size e-posta ile bilgi verilecektir.';
  document.getElementById('d_msg').className = 'text-sm min-h-[1.25rem] text-green-600';
};
</script>
